 'uj2a2o': {'abilities': {'Acts of Faith': {'desc': 'If your Army Faction is '
                                                    'Adepta Sororitas, each '
                                                    'unit from your army with '
                                                    'this ability can perform '
                                                    'one Act of Faith per '
                                                    'phase. This is done using '
                                                    'Miracle dice.\n'
                                                    'GAINING MIRACLE DICE\n'
                                                    'If your Army Faction is '
                                                    'Adepta Sororitas, you '
                                                    'gain 1 Miracle dice:\n'
                                                    '\n'
                                                    'At the start of each '
                                                    'battle round.\n'
                                                    'Each time an Adepta '
                                                    'Sororitas unit from your '
                                                    'army is destroyed.\n'
                                                    '\n'
                                                    'Each time you gain a '
                                                    'Miracle dice, roll one '
                                                    'D6. The number you roll '
                                                    'is the value of that '
                                                    'Miracle dice. This value '
                                                    'cannot be changed or '
                                                    're-rolled, unless a rule '
                                                    'specifically states '
                                                    'otherwise. Keep your '
                                                    'Miracle dice to one side '
                                                    '– this is your Miracle '
                                                    'dice pool.\n'
                                                    'PERFORMING AN ACT OF '
                                                    'FAITH\n'
                                                    'Before making a dice roll '
                                                    'for a model or unit from '
                                                    'your army with the Acts '
                                                    'of Faith ability, if you '
                                                    'have one or more dice in '
                                                    'your Miracle dice pool, '
                                                    'that unit can perform an '
                                                    'Act of Faith. If it does, '
                                                    'select one of the dice '
                                                    'from your Miracle dice '
                                                    'pool to substitute that '
                                                    'dice roll (if a roll '
                                                    'involves more than one '
                                                    'dice, e.g. a Charge roll '
                                                    'or Battle-shock test, '
                                                    'only a single dice can\n'
                                                    'be substituted). The dice '
                                                    'that is being substituted '
                                                    'is not rolled; instead '
                                                    'the value of the selected '
                                                    'Miracle dice is used as '
                                                    'if it had been rolled '
                                                    '(this counts as an '
                                                    'unmodified dice roll of '
                                                    'that value for all rules '
                                                    'purposes). Each Miracle '
                                                    'dice can only be selected '
                                                    'for substitution once. '
                                                    'Once all Miracle dice '
                                                    'substitutions have been '
                                                    'made, remove the chosen '
                                                    'Miracle dice from your '
                                                    'Miracle dice pool, and '
                                                    'roll all remaining, '
                                                    'unsubstituted dice that '
                                                    'are a part of the dice '
                                                    'roll. You can use Miracle '
                                                    'dice when a unit performs '
                                                    'an Act of Faith for any '
                                                    'of the following types of '
                                                    'dice roll:\n'
                                                    '■ Advance roll\n'
                                                    '■ Battle-shock test\n'
                                                    '■ Charge roll\n'
                                                    '■ Damage roll\n'
                                                    '■ Hit roll\n'
                                                    '■ Saving throw\n'
                                                    '■ Wound roll',
